                                        "entry_id": "c78c236b-f546-36a5-bab8-ae1ded0ef27f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fruit of the capsicum plant: red, green, yellow or white, hollow and containing seeds, and in a wide range of mild (sweet, nonspicy) to hot (spicy) varieties."
